  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "Highly formal requests soften the demand: 'I would be grateful if you could ...', 'Would it be possible to ...?'. These are common in professional emails and formal spoken requests, especially to superiors or in customer service.",
    "explanation_ko": "매우 격식적인 요청은 요구를 완화합니다: 'I would be grateful if you could ...', 'Would it be possible to ...?'. 업무 이메일이나 격식적인 구두 요청, 특히 상사나 고객 서비스에서 흔합니다.",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "I would be grateful if you could send the file today.",
        "ko": "오늘 파일을 보내주시면 감사하겠습니다."
      },
      {
        "en": "Would it be possible to reschedule our meeting?",
        "ko": "회의 일정을 변경하는 게 가능할까요?"
      },
      {
        "en": "I would appreciate it if you could confirm by Friday.",
        "ko": "금요일까지 확인해주시면 감사하겠습니다."
      }
    ]
  },
